An ominous feeling lingers in the air. The Lost Island seems different somehow, more eerie. Deep down you know there are places you should stay away from, but there’s glory to be had for the brave. And what’s that new area forming on your map? It almost looks… cursed.

We have two new features launching next week for only the bravest of adventurers. More danger, more reward, and we know how much our community loves a challenge. Keep an eye out for the release next week! In the meantime, have a riddle:

What has cities, but no houses;
forests, but no trees;
and water, but no fish?
